    "table|take|take care|take off|take on|take out|take over|take place|take up|tale|talk|talk about|tall|task|taste|tattered|tax|teach|teacher|team|tear|technical|technique|telephone|tell|temperature|ten|tend|tendency|term|test|text|then|theory|there|therefore|thermal|thick|thin|thing|think|think about|think of|third|thought|thousand|threat|threaten|three|throat|throw|thrust|thus|thyroid|tie|tight|time|tip|tissue|title|today|together|tomorrow|tone|tongue|tonight|too|too much|tool|tooth|top|toss|total|touch|tough|town|trace|trade|tradition|traditional|trail|train|training|transfer|transform|translate|travel|treat|treatment|tree|tremendous|trend|trial|trip|troops|trouble|truck|true|truly|trust|truth|try|tsunami|tube|turn|turn out|turn to|twelve|twenty|twice|twist|two|type|typical"
